# Monorepo

- Apps: `api` (`@cabin/api` Nest), `pms` (`@cabin/pms` Vite/React/Tailwind/shadcn + `@cabin/ui-tokens`), `web` (`@cabin/web` Phase 2 customer FE — Vite/React/Tailwind/shadcn + `@cabin/ui-tokens` + i18n en/id/zh + prerender/SSG; CDN in front of public origin).
- Shared libs: `packages/*` — code needed by **2+ apps** (types, constants, pure helpers). Apps depend via `workspace:*`. See `packages/README.md` + `.cursor/rules/monorepo-tooling.mdc`.
- **pnpm only** from repo root. Never `npm i` inside an app or package.
- One API only. Product: `AGENTS.md` + `_docs/cabin-pms-client-plan.md`. Reservations/money: `_docs/reservations-design.md`.
- **Phase 1** = prod staff PMS (`api` + `pms`) for live manual + OTA — incl. reservations + money/DP (`Total` quote + `PaymentMovement` cash ledger; Paid = sum). **Phase 2** = public `web` book FE only (same reservation domain; Nest `/public`). No CM or OTA scraping in Phase 1. Next.js is **not** the default for `web`.
- Unique-unit calendars. Overlap safety in Postgres. `CONFIRMED` ≠ paid.
- Tooling pitfalls (pnpm builds, Prisma output, single `.env`, ESLint per app, shared packages): `.cursor/rules/monorepo-tooling.mdc`.
- Docker: `docker-compose.yml` = VPS stack (postgres+api+pms+web+garage+Loki+Gotenberg; FE `:8080` · web `:3050` · archive S3 `:3900` · archive GET `:3910`; later HTTPS closes those — `deploy/garage/README.md`); `docker-compose.dev.yml` = local Postgres + Garage + optional logs (`pnpm db:up` / `archive:up` / `logs:up`) + optional Gotenberg (`pnpm gotenberg:up`). Deploy on push to `release` via **GHCR** (build on GitHub, pull on VPS); direct-on-VPS backup workflow available.
- When editing `AGENTS.md` or `.cursor/rules/*.mdc`: **general patterns, not one-off cases** — see root `AGENTS.md` → “How to write…” and `.cursor/rules/agents-writing.mdc`. App rules scale via layered globs — map: `.cursor/rules/README.md`.
- Open the repo via `cabin.code-workspace` when IDE diagnostics look wrong.
